While your foes are distracted by your Awesome Toss, you use powerful steam motors to jump into the air and kick a target [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] tiles away.

The impact is so great that it ripples outwards, slowing all creatures in radius 3 by [14%, 29%, 37%, 43%, 47% (TL1-5)] for 4 turns while the reaction force propels you [4, 5, 6, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] tiles backwards.
